OL,3,GNEWSAShoppers fill Oxford Street on
OL,4,Afirst traffic-free day
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of Oxford Street has been
OL,7,Fpedestrianised, with visitors
OL,8,Fexperiencing the first day that cars,
OL,9,Ftaxis, buses and bicycles have been
OL,10,Fbanned from some of the central London
OL,11,Fstreet.
OL,13,FAlmost 1km (0.62-mile) of the popular
OL,14,Fshopping destination has been
OL,15,Fpedestrianised between Orchard Street
OL,16,Fand Great Portland Street by the
OL,17,Fmayor's Oxford Street Development
OL,18,FCorporation.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
