OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAShoppers fill Oxford Street on
OL,4,Afirst traffic-free day
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe change has been welcomed by some
OL,7,Fshoppers, although questions have been
OL,8,Fraised about how accessible it will be
OL,9,Ffor disabled visitors.
OL,11,FLondon's mayor Lord Sadiq Khan said it
OL,12,Fwas a "momentous day for London", and
OL,13,Fthe changes were the first phase in
OL,14,Flifting the street out of "decline".
